# Bidora — Product Auction API

A RESTful backend API for **Bidora**, an online auction platform where sellers list products, buyers place bids, and administrators manage auctions, wallet/escrow payments, verification, delivery, and disputes.

Built with **ASP.NET Core 10**, **Entity Framework Core 10**, **SQL Server**, **ASP.NET Core Identity**, and **JWT Bearer authentication**.

