## Standardized API Response Format

Every endpoint returns a consistent envelope so any client can parse responses uniformly.

### Success (with payload)

```json
{
  "status": 200,
  "message": "Login successful.",
  "data": {
    "token": "...",
    "roles": ["Buyer"],
    "email": "...",
    "expiresInMinutes": 120
  }
}
```

### Success (no payload)

When there is no data to return, the `data` field is omitted entirely (never `null`):

```json
{ "status": 200, "message": "Category deleted successfully." }
```

### Paginated list

```json
{
  "status": 200,
  "message": "Auctions retrieved successfully.",
  "data": [
    /* items */
  ],
  "pagination": { "page": 1, "pageSize": 20, "totalCount": 137 }
}
```

> `totalPages` is intentionally **not** returned; clients compute it from `totalCount` and `pageSize`.

### Error

```json
{
  "status": 400,
  "message": "Invalid email or password.",
  "errors": ["Field is required."]
}
```

> `errors` is present only for validation/error detail.

### Endpoint-specific shapes

- Most list endpoints return `data` as an **array** plus `pagination`.
- A few endpoints that carry aggregate counters keep those counters **inside `data`** (e.g. `data = { items, totalSalesCount, ... }`) while still returning `pagination` as a sibling.
- The admin disputes list adds a sibling `summary` object with status counts.

### HTTP status codes used

| Code | Meaning                              |
| ---- | ------------------------------------ |
| 200  | OK                                   |
| 201  | Created                              |
| 400  | Bad Request / validation             |
| 401  | Unauthorized (missing/invalid token) |
| 403  | Forbidden (role/ownership)           |
| 404  | Not Found                            |
| 409  | Conflict                             |
| 500  | Server error                         |

---

## Features

### Authentication & User Management

- Registration (Buyer/Seller) and login with JWT.
- ASP.NET Core Identity integration (password hashing, lockout).
- Role-based authorization (Admin, Super Admin, Seller, Buyer, plus custom roles).
- Current-user retrieval and profile update (including NID image upload).
- Password change.
- Login rate limiting (5 requests/minute).

### Product & Category Management

- Seller product creation/editing with image uploads (jpg/jpeg/png/webp, max 5 MB each).
- Submit for approval (reserves 25% seller deposit) / withdraw / delete (Draft/Rejected).
- Admin approval/rejection workflow.
- Category listing, creation, deletion (admin only).

### Auction Management

- Public auction listing, home feed (banner + active + upcoming), and detail.
- Admin auction configuration (start/end time) and cancellation.
- Seller-scoped auction details (includes cancellation reason).
- Automatic activation/result processing via background services.
- Re-auction: sellers reset eligible products (`NoWinner`/`PaymentOverdue`) back to Draft.

### Bidding

- Buyer bid placement with min-increment, starting-price, buyout-cap, and wallet checks.
- Bid history (public and admin views).
- Buyout ("Buy It Now") that creates a sale immediately.

### Wallet & Financial Management

- Per-user wallet (balance, reserved balance, available balance).
- Deposit requests with receipt image + admin review.
- Wallet transactions ledger (Credit/Debit/Reserve/Release/Penalty/Commission).
- Wallet reservations (SellerDeposit / BuyerFunds / SaleEscrow).
- Platform wallet, global transactions, reservations, and summary stats.

### Sales & Delivery

- Sale lifecycle: `AwaitingPayment → Paid → Dispatched → Completed` (plus `PaymentOverdue`, `Disputed`, `Refunded`).
- Buyer payment from wallet; escrow hold; platform commission (10%).
- Seller dispatch with tracking info + evidence (5-day deadline).
- Buyer receipt confirmation (with proof) releasing seller proceeds.
- Seller non-delivery reporting.
- Overdue payment/dispatch monitoring via background services.

### Dispute Management

- Buyer/seller dispute submission with optional evidence image.
- Admin review (`start-review`) and resolution with fault type, penalty split, and wallet settlement.

### Verification (KYC-style)

- Users submit NID number + front/back images.
- Admin verifies or rejects (with reason).

### Background Processing

- Auction activation, auction result finalization, payment-overdue, dispatch-overdue (30s polling).

---

## API Reference

All routes are prefixed with `/api`. Protected endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <token>` unless marked Public.

### Auth — `/api/auth`

| Method | Route              | Auth   | Description                                                                          |
| ------ | ------------------ | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| POST   | `/register`        | Public | Register a Buyer or Seller (creates profile + wallet).                               |
| POST   | `/login`           | Public | Validate credentials; returns token, roles, email, `expiresInMinutes`. Rate-limited. |
| GET    | `/test-token`      | Bearer | Decode/inspect current token claims.                                                 |
| GET    | `/me`              | Bearer | Current account + profile.                                                           |
| PUT    | `/me`              | Bearer | Update profile fields and NID images (multipart).                                    |
| POST   | `/change-password` | Bearer | Change the current user's password.                                                  |

### Admin — `/api/Admin` `[Authorize(Roles = "Admin,Super Admin")]`

| Method | Route                           | Description                                                 |
| ------ | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/dashboard`                    | Aggregated platform stats.                                  |
| POST   | `/create-admin`                 | Create a staff account (Super Admin gated for admin roles). |
| PUT    | `/user/{id}`                    | Edit a staff account (name/email/role).                     |
| PUT    | `/user/{id}/reset-password`     | Reset a staff account password.                             |
| GET    | `/user`                         | Paginated user list (search + role filter).                 |
| PUT    | `/user/{id}/lock`               | Lock/unlock a user (temporary or permanent).                |
| GET    | `/auctions`                     | All auctions (status filter, search, pagination).           |
| POST   | `/disputes/{id}/start-review`   | Move a dispute to `UnderReview`.                            |
| GET    | `/deposit-requests`             | Deposit requests (status filter + pagination).              |
| PUT    | `/deposit-requests/{id}/review` | Approve (credit wallet) or reject a deposit.                |
| GET    | `/transactions`                 | All wallet transactions + summary stats.                    |
| GET    | `/reservations`                 | All wallet reservations.                                    |
| GET    | `/platform-wallet`              | Platform system wallet + history + totals.                  |
| GET    | `/user/role-counts`             | User counts per role.                                       |

### Auction — `/api/auction`

| Method | Route                                      | Auth         | Description                                                                   |
| ------ | ------------------------------------------ | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/`                                        | Public       | List auctions (search, category, status filter, pagination, banner fallback). |
| GET    | `/home`                                    | Public       | Banner + up to 8 active + up to 8 upcoming.                                   |
| GET    | `/{id}`                                    | Public       | Auction detail (product, images, bids).                                       |
| GET    | `/{id}/seller`                             | Bearer       | Seller-scoped detail (incl. cancellation reason).                             |
| PUT    | `/{id}/configure`                          | Admin        | Set start/end time for an upcoming auction.                                   |
| PUT    | `/{id}/cancel`                             | Seller/Admin | Cancel an upcoming (seller) or upcoming/active (admin) auction.               |
| POST   | `/product/{productId}/reset-for-reauction` | Seller       | Reset a settled product to Draft for re-auction.                              |

### Bid — `/api/bid` `[Authorize]`

| Method | Route                             | Auth   | Description                                               |
| ------ | --------------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| POST   | `/`                               | Buyer  | Place a bid.                                              |
| GET    | `/auction/{auctionId}/bids`       | Public | Bid history (newest first).                               |
| GET    | `/auction/{auctionId}/bids/admin` | Admin  | Admin bid history (bidder email, buyout flag, isHighest). |
| POST   | `/{auctionId}/buyout`             | Buyer  | Instant buyout; creates a sale.                           |

### Buyer — `/api/Buyer` `[Authorize(Roles = "Buyer")]`

| Method | Route           | Description                                                |
| ------ | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/dashboard`    | Buyer stats and balances.                                  |
| GET    | `/my-bids`      | Paginated bid history (search + status filter).            |
| GET    | `/won-auctions` | Paginated won auctions (payment/delivery/dispute details). |

### Category — `/api/category`

| Method | Route   | Auth   | Description                                          |
| ------ | ------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/`     | Public | List categories (product count, search, pagination). |
| POST   | `/`     | Admin  | Create a category.                                   |
| DELETE | `/{id}` | Admin  | Delete a category.                                   |

### Dispute — `/api/dispute` `[Authorize]`

| Method | Route           | Auth   | Description                                                |
| ------ | --------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/`             | Admin  | All disputes (status filter, search, pagination, summary). |
| POST   | `/`             | Bearer | Buyer/seller creates a dispute (evidence optional).        |
| PUT    | `/{id}/resolve` | Admin  | Resolve with fault type, penalty split, wallet settlement. |

### Health — `/api/health`

| Method | Route | Auth   | Description                                                                                |
| ------ | ----- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| GET    | `/`   | Public | Lightweight DB connectivity probe; returns `healthy`, `database`, `serverTime`, `message`. |

### Product — `/api/product` `[Authorize]`

| Method | Route                       | Auth   | Description                                                           |
| ------ | --------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/my-products`              | Seller | Seller products (approval/auction status filter, search, pagination). |
| GET    | `/my-products/{id}`         | Seller | Single seller-owned product with images.                              |
| POST   | `/`                         | Seller | Create a Draft product (multipart).                                   |
| PUT    | `/{id}`                     | Seller | Update a Draft/Rejected product + images.                             |
| POST   | `/{id}/submit-for-approval` | Seller | Submit for approval (reserves seller deposit).                        |
| POST   | `/{id}/withdraw`            | Seller | Withdraw a pending submission (releases deposit).                     |
| DELETE | `/{id}`                     | Seller | Delete a Draft/Rejected product.                                      |
| GET    | `/pending-approval`         | Admin  | Products awaiting approval.                                           |
| GET    | `/pending-approval/{id}`    | Admin  | Full details of a pending product.                                    |
| PUT    | `/{id}/approval`            | Admin  | Approve (creates auction) or reject (releases deposit).               |

### Profile — `/api/profile` `[Authorize]`

| Method | Route                   | Auth   | Description                     |
| ------ | ----------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------- |
| PUT    | `/submit-verification`  | Bearer | Submit NID for verification.    |
| GET    | `/pending-verification` | Admin  | Profiles awaiting verification. |
| PUT    | `/{id}/verify`          | Admin  | Mark profile Verified/Rejected. |

### Role — `/api/admin/roles` `[Authorize(Roles = "Admin,Super Admin")]`

| Method | Route   | Description                                       |
| ------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/`     | List roles (with user counts).                    |
| GET    | `/{id}` | Get a role.                                       |
| POST   | `/`     | Create a custom role.                             |
| PUT    | `/{id}` | Rename a role (protected roles blocked).          |
| DELETE | `/{id}` | Delete a role (protected/assigned roles blocked). |

### Sale — `/api/sale` `[Authorize]`

| Method | Route                       | Auth   | Description                                                    |
| ------ | --------------------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/`                         | Admin  | All sales (status/delivery filter, search, pagination, stats). |
| GET    | `/my-sales`                 | Bearer | Buyer/seller's own sales (pagination, revenue totals).         |
| POST   | `/{id}/pay`                 | Buyer  | Pay for an `AwaitingPayment` sale from wallet (escrow hold).   |
| POST   | `/{id}/dispatch`            | Seller | Record dispatch (tracking + evidence).                         |
| POST   | `/{id}/report-non-delivery` | Seller | Report non-delivery after pickup window.                       |
| POST   | `/{id}/confirm-receipt`     | Buyer  | Confirm receipt (proof) → pays seller, releases escrow.        |

### Seller — `/api/Seller` `[Authorize(Roles = "Seller")]`

| Method | Route        | Description                         |
| ------ | ------------ | ----------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/dashboard` | Seller stats and available balance. |

### Wallet — `/api/wallet` `[Authorize]`

| Method | Route               | Description                                                               |
| ------ | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/me`               | Current wallet (balance, reserved, available).                            |
| POST   | `/deposit-request`  | Create a deposit request (multipart: method, amount, reference, receipt). |
| GET    | `/deposit-requests` | User's deposit requests (status filter, search, pagination).              |
| GET    | `/transactions`     | User's wallet transactions (type filter, search, pagination).             |
| GET    | `/reservations`     | User's wallet reservations (status filter, pagination).                   |

