## Development Notes

- Controllers are grouped by feature; DTOs are grouped by feature.
- All responses use the standardized envelope (`status`, `message`, `data`, optional `pagination`/`errors`).
- Uploaded images are served as static files under `/uploads/`.
- Background services run on a 30-second poll; adjust intervals for faster/slower processing if needed.
- Use `dotnet watch run` for iterative development.

